<title>UK: BTI sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</title>
<headline>BTI sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc has issued 20 million American-style call warrants on shares of Credit Suisse lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    200 CHF		   PREMIUM	14.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.51 CHF		  GEARING	12.45 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BTWEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
